{"sectionId":"organic_rxn/alcohol-ether","items":[{"id":"organic_rxn--alcohol-ether-k001","sectionId":"organic_rxn/alcohol-ether","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"1차 alcohol은 적절한 온화한 산화제에서 aldehyde, 강한 수용성 산화 조건에서 carboxylic acid로 산화될 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--alcohol-ether-k002","sectionId":"organic_rxn/alcohol-ether","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"2차 alcohol은 ketone, 3차 alcohol은 일반적인 온화한 산화에서 carbonyl을 형성하기 어렵다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--alcohol-ether-k003","sectionId":"organic_rxn/alcohol-ether","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"NaBH₄는 보통 aldehyde와 ketone을 alcohol로 환원하며 LiAlH₄는 더 강해 acid와 ester 등도 환원할 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--alcohol-ether-k004","sectionId":"organic_rxn/alcohol-ether","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"OH는 그대로는 불량 이탈기여서 산에 의한 양성자화 또는 sulfonate ester 형성 등으로 활성화할 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--alcohol-ether-k005","sectionId":"organic_rxn/alcohol-ether","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"Williamson ether synthesis는 alkoxide가 methyl/1차 alkyl halide 등에 SN2 공격하는 대표 반응이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--alcohol-ether-k006","sectionId":"organic_rxn/alcohol-ether","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"3차 기질은 제거 경쟁이 크다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--alcohol-ether-k007","sectionId":"organic_rxn/alcohol-ether","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"ether는 강한 HI/HBr 조건에서 절단될 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--alcohol-ether-k008","sectionId":"organic_rxn/alcohol-ether","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"epoxide는 고리 strain으로 친핵성 개환이 쉽다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--alcohol-ether-k009","sectionId":"organic_rxn/alcohol-ether","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"염기성 조건에서는 덜 치환된 탄소에 SN2형 공격이 일반적이며 산촉매 조건에서는 양성자화 후 더 치환된 탄소에 공격이 유리한 경우가 많다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--alcohol-ether-k010","sectionId":"organic_rxn/alcohol-ether","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"두 경우 모두 공격 탄소에서 입체 반전 경향을 고려한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--alcohol-ether-k011","sectionId":"organic_rxn/alcohol-ether","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"PCC 등 온화한 조건: 1차 alcohol→aldehyde.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--alcohol-ether-k012","sectionId":"organic_rxn/alcohol-ether","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"NaBH₄와 LiAlH₄의 환원 범위가 다르다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--alcohol-ether-k013","sectionId":"organic_rxn/alcohol-ether","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"Williamson 반응은 입체장애 적은 alkyl 기질이 유리하다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--alcohol-ether-k014","sectionId":"organic_rxn/alcohol-ether","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"epoxide 개환의 위치선택성은 산·염기 조건에 따라 달라질 수 있다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--alcohol-ether-k015","sectionId":"organic_rxn/alcohol-ether","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"Acetone이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]}]}